l complaints against U.K. fund Hermes, accusing it of stock manipulation in a case involving trading in Samsung shares last year.  \par \par \uc2 * Wipro's earnings rose 19% for its first quarter, and the Indian firm said it aims to battle sliding margins by increasing the types of outsourcing work it does and focusing less on the call-centre business.  \par \par \uc2 ASIA-PRESS-WALLST|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|REVU|G|J|Z|SI|SNS|SNI|AUF|ND|PHD|IF|RNP|DNP|PGE|PCO  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050724e17o000cb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
