\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysia Ringgit Stablizes At MYR3.79 After Central Bk Move \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 April 1998\par 06:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (Dow Jones)--The Malaysian ringgit is stabilizing midday in Asian trading thanks to dollar-selling from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rising above MYR3.80. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there was modest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling through agent banks in the morning session after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to MYR3.82 against the dollar. The fall was triggered by Standard & Poor's move Friday to downgrade Malaysia's long-term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rating to single-A-minus from single-A. \par \par \uc2  S&P based the downgrade on the first stagnation in the Malaysian economy for a decade. This has deepened asset quality problems, and the rating agency expects non-performing loans to result. \par \par \uc2  However, after this downgrade, S&P said the ratings outlook for Malaysia is stable. \par \par \uc2  At 0414 GMT (12:14 a.m. EDT), the dollar is at MYR3.7900, still higher than MYR3.7675 late Friday, but off its intraday peaks. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reached a high of MYR3.8200 earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  However, concerns about the Malaysian government's apparent willingness to provide funds for troubled companies continues to unsettle the market. Analysts have said recent comments to this effect from Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad given the impression that the government believes that it can ride out the continuing turmoil without restructuring the way the economy is run. \par \par \uc2  -By James Hookway; 603 292 5254; jhookway@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 20-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0431GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 1851 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4k0399w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
